after they shelved Training A-Train?

21:14.065 --> 21:15.608
-[grunts softly]
-Oh, yeah.

21:15.692 --> 21:18.611
And at first,
I drowned my sorrows in crack,

21:18.695 --> 21:22.532
nitrous, huffing glue, huffing paint,
paint thinners, cough medicine, guns,

21:22.615 --> 21:24.075
high-risk sex, codeine.

21:24.158 --> 21:25.952
Do you ever fuck on codeine?

21:26.911 --> 21:28.287
[sighs]

21:28.371 --> 21:29.914
But that's not the answer.

21:29.998 --> 21:32.208
[gentle music playing]

21:32.291 --> 21:34.836
This play.

21:34.919 --> 21:36.587
It saved me.

21:36.671 --> 21:38.256
You saved me.

21:38.339 --> 21:40.258
Wow. Thank you.

21:40.341 --> 21:43.386
No. Kid, thank you.

21:43.469 --> 21:45.054
'Cause I got some big news.

21:46.139 --> 21:47.140
We're going to Broadway.

21:47.223 --> 21:49.726
