No more mindless studio bullshit.

21:49.809 --> 21:52.437
I can finally be the artist
I always dreamed of, and you...

21:52.520 --> 21:56.149
Kid, you have no idea,
but you're gonna be a fucking star.

21:56.232 --> 22:00.820
So, you ditch that office gig 'cause
you and I, we are gonna save the world.

22:02.447 --> 22:03.448
With our talent.

22:03.531 --> 22:06.284
Oh, my God. You have no idea
how much this means to me!

22:06.367 --> 22:09.454
[chuckles, grunts] I love you, kid.

22:12.040 --> 22:14.292
You start your vocal warm-ups.

22:14.375 --> 22:16.419
