22:22.759 --> 22:24.761
Fucking Tony Gilroy.

22:24.844 --> 22:27.472
-[suspenseful music playing]
-[water bubbling]

22:29.015 --> 22:31.267
-[squelching]
-[screaming]

22:31.350 --> 22:33.269
[screeching]

22:33.352 --> 22:34.645
Oh, my God!

22:34.729 --> 22:37.273
-[intense music playing]
-[screaming]

22:37.356 --> 22:39.025
[Black Noir] Adam?

22:40.610 --> 22:42.236
Holy shit.

22:42.320 --> 22:43.696
