23:22.527 --> 23:24.195
[squeaks weakly]

23:26.656 --> 23:28.241
[door opens]

23:28.324 --> 23:29.367
-[door closes]
-Hey, bro.

23:29.450 --> 23:32.537
Don't you fucking "hey bro" me.
What the fuck is wrong with you?

23:33.704 --> 23:35.957
Nothing. Why? What's wrong with you?

23:36.040 --> 23:39.502
I call you a "clam diver," and you send
