at your play rehearsal today?

23:41.963 --> 23:43.756
Which is definitely not your job.

23:43.840 --> 23:46.801
The lead producer's stepping away.
They're shuttering the production.

23:46.884 --> 23:48.636
[scoffs] He had it coming.

23:48.719 --> 23:51.013
Fucker didn't use my improvs
in Dawn of the Seven.

23:51.097 --> 23:52.974
He believed in me, you fuckwit!

23:53.057 --> 23:55.893
And for what? 'Cause I fucking
upstaged you with Oh Father?

23:55.977 --> 23:57.603
[tense music playing]

23:57.687 --> 23:58.813
Here's what gonna happen now.

23:58.896 --> 24:03.109
You are gonna fucking do
whatever I say whenever I say it,

24:03.192 --> 24:06.612
