the National Endowment for the Arts.

24:14.453 --> 24:17.498
You have nothing to say? Nice.

24:18.583 --> 24:20.960
You're really getting the hang
of that Meisner technique, huh?

24:21.043 --> 24:23.171
-[intense music playing]
-[door opens, closes]

24:26.507 --> 24:27.508
[uplifting music playing]

24:27.592 --> 24:30.511
-Hey. Hey, buddy.
-[Terror panting]

24:30.595 --> 24:33.806
Good boy. Good boy.

24:33.890 --> 24:35.433
Hi.

24:35.516 --> 24:37.476
[music distorting]

24:37.560 --> 24:39.854
You want to fuck me?

24:39.937 --> 24:43.191
[distorted] You want to fuck me
like a good boy?

24:43.274 --> 24:46.068
[narrator over TV] And Americans,
God's chosen people.

24:46.152 --> 24:48.821
So shouldn't we have our own church
for Americans?

24:48.905 --> 24:52.033
With American grit and American values?

24:52.116 --> 24:56.078
Founded by the greatest American
of us all?

24:56.162 --> 24:57.246
A true American prophet?

24:57.330 --> 24:59.207
-[squeaking rhythmically]
-[door opens]

24:59.290 --> 25:00.291
Hold on.

25:00.374 --> 25:01.834
What're you doing?

25:01.918 --> 25:04.545
Frenchie won't cook my steak
