25:06.756 --> 25:08.174
Okay, and why don't you tell him that?

25:08.257 --> 25:10.551
I have.

25:10.635 --> 25:15.431
Maybe we just don't like the same...
steak, you know?

25:17.850 --> 25:19.685
Jesus Christ.

25:19.769 --> 25:22.188
Has Butcher ever washed this thing? Oh.

25:22.271 --> 25:24.941
Ugh, that thing is, like,
glazed in dog semen.

25:25.024 --> 25:26.275
Like a come doughnut.

25:26.359 --> 25:29.028
Come-nut? Did I just invent a new word?

25:29.111 --> 25:31.739
You know what? I am gonna
do us all a favor and wash this.

25:31.822 --> 25:35.159
Terror, your boyfriend is about to become
a virgin all over again.

25:35.243 --> 25:36.244
Oof.

25:36.327 --> 25:37.995
[Kimiko] Good boy.

25:39.997 --> 25:41.874
[door closes]

25:41.958 --> 25:43.376
[lighthearted music playing]

25:43.459 --> 25:46.170
[quiet squeaking in distance]

25:50.967 --> 25:52.551
[wheels squeaking]

25:56.222 --> 25:57.473
[Mother's Milk] The fuck is that?

25:57.556 --> 25:59.475
You finally building yourself a fuck-bot?

25:59.558 --> 26:02.603
Something me and Frenchie
are working on. [sighs]

26:02.687 --> 26:04.981
Proper preparation and planning, my son.

26:05.064 --> 26:06.482
None of my fucking business, got it.

26:06.565 --> 26:08.150
Yeah, that's the one.

26:08.234 --> 26:10.486
-Any leads on Bombsight?
-Not a damn thing.

26:10.569 --> 26:12.488
[Butcher] Well, he's an unbreakable cunt
