26:19.203 --> 26:21.789
How about Legend?
That old bastard knows everyone.

26:21.872 --> 26:22.873
He's in the wind.

26:22.957 --> 26:25.918
And if I had as much shit on Vought
as he did, I'd fuck off, too.

26:27.086 --> 26:28.337
Ah, shit.

26:28.421 --> 26:29.672
Wait, wait, wait.

26:29.755 --> 26:31.048
-Oi. Terror, no!
-Hey, hey, hey!

26:31.132 --> 26:32.675
-Get down. No, Terror. Oi.
-Good boy. Good boy.

26:32.758 --> 26:34.385
Oi, oi, oi, oi. No.

26:34.468 --> 26:36.679
You can't have no chocolate, mate.

26:36.762 --> 26:38.556
Yeah, get your own chocolate.

26:42.560 --> 26:44.061
[Mother's Milk] Mmm.

26:44.145 --> 26:45.271
What?

26:45.980 --> 26:47.773
-Three Mississippi rule.
-Bloody hell.

26:47.857 --> 26:49.525
I never thought I'd see the day.

26:49.608 --> 26:51.527
It's got a fucking pubic hair on it
and all.

26:51.610 --> 26:53.404
Tasty, too. Hmm?

26:55.281 --> 26:56.824
[laughs]

26:56.907 --> 26:59.035
You know what's funny?

26:59.118 --> 27:02.913
Here we are, parked in the middle of hell,

27:02.997 --> 27:06.709
