so good in my entire life.

27:06.792 --> 27:09.211
-What's different?
-Well, like you,

27:09.295 --> 27:12.715
I just finally realized
that I'm already dead.

27:13.924 --> 27:20.139
And once I just gave up that stress
of needing to stay alive, it's like,

27:20.222 --> 27:21.724
shit got easier.

27:21.807 --> 27:23.768
You know, I spent my whole life

27:23.851 --> 27:27.188
