for what he did to my family.

27:27.271 --> 27:29.398
Yet he's immortal?

27:30.566 --> 27:33.486
He's immune? [scoffs]

27:33.569 --> 27:35.780
What kind of fucking cosmic joke is that?

27:35.863 --> 27:37.740
So, you tell me, Butcher.

27:39.492 --> 27:41.202
