27:41.285 --> 27:45.748
Well, you keep going
for Monique, for Janine.

27:45.831 --> 27:47.166
They're better off without me.

27:47.249 --> 27:50.127
How can a man so smart be so fucking daft?

27:50.211 --> 27:51.379
They are.

27:51.462 --> 27:54.215
And I'm better off without them.

27:54.298 --> 27:58.135
Because if I thought that
there was a snowball's chance in hell

27:58.219 --> 27:59.929
that I might see them again...

28:02.139 --> 28:07.770
