28:17.154 --> 28:18.572
[object clatters in distance]

28:18.656 --> 28:21.200
[lighthearted music playing]

28:21.283 --> 28:23.285
[Terror panting]

28:27.456 --> 28:28.416
[Frenchie] Oh.

28:28.499 --> 28:30.751
Bonsoir, mon toutou.

28:30.835 --> 28:33.003
You wonder what am I doing? [laughs]

28:33.087 --> 28:38.968
Oh, well, first, I made Kimiko
the perfect French ribeye.

28:39.051 --> 28:42.054
You know, she loves my steak.

28:42.138 --> 28:46.350
And for dessert, my soufflé au chocolat.

28:46.434 --> 28:48.686
It's a thing of legend.

28:53.941 --> 28:55.484
[Frenchie sighs]

28:55.568 --> 28:57.528
You know, she wants one of you.

28:57.611 --> 29:00.197
To... I don't know.

29:00.281 --> 29:03.325
