29:03.409 --> 29:05.995
Eat? Sleep? Oh, fetch.

29:06.078 --> 29:10.374
[chuckles] I throw the ball,
you bring it back.

29:10.458 --> 29:13.294
I throw the ball, you bring it back.

29:13.377 --> 29:16.088
