29:32.480 --> 29:33.814
A normal life.

29:35.232 --> 29:36.567
But I...

29:38.486 --> 29:41.071
[melancholy music playing]

29:41.155 --> 29:43.824
I don't know how to give her this.

29:46.827 --> 29:49.163
If I even can.

29:49.246 --> 29:50.498
[grunts softly]

29:51.499 --> 29:55.169
-[timer ringing]
-Oh! Oh, la, la, la, la.

29:58.547 --> 30:01.717
No, no, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no. Aw...

30:01.800 --> 30:03.093
Fils de pute!

30:04.261 --> 30:05.387
[sighs]

30:06.388 --> 30:07.932
[inhales sharply]

30:08.015 --> 30:10.059
I need fresh air. You want to come?

30:10.142 --> 30:11.185
Outside?

30:11.268 --> 30:12.770
No?

30:12.853 --> 30:14.355
Okay.

30:19.318 --> 30:20.945
[Hughie] If you and M.M. still think--

30:21.028 --> 30:22.571
[Butcher] Oh, for fuck's sakes,
Hughie, knock it off

30:22.655 --> 30:25.282
with this V1 shite.
You're doing me fucking head in.

30:26.367 --> 30:30.287
Oi. Terror. Cut it out. Come on.

30:30.371 --> 30:32.414
Now, listen, if we do find that stuff,

30:32.498 --> 30:34.959
