have to decide for the rest of us?

30:43.634 --> 30:45.427
Oh, 'cause I'm fucking right!

30:45.511 --> 30:46.804
'Cause I've always been right!

30:46.887 --> 30:49.056
I've been telling you lot
from the fucking start

30:49.139 --> 30:51.684
the sky is falling, and guess what.

30:51.767 --> 30:53.310
The sky fucking fell.

30:53.394 --> 30:56.438
-Well, you kind of helped bring it down.
-Oh, don't give me that bollocks.

30:56.522 --> 30:59.942
Listen, Homelander thinks
he's a fucking god.

31:00.025 --> 31:02.695
